  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given straight lines are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math>. Clearly, these straight lines are perpendicular to each other <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and intersect at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>. Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> are points on these lines such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>From figure it is clear that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0012_6df6b031588b.png\" style=\"width: 310px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p>Let slope of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>. Then,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></math></p><p>or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Hence, equation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, option (c) is correct.</p>"
  }
